 • Bain Capital and Apax Partners are no longer seeking to buy Trimble 's (Nasdaq: TRMB) transportation and logistics portfolio, per Axios Pro . axios.link/46k0usm 

 • Basware , a Finnish portfolio company of Accel-KKR , acquired Trustpair, a French provider of invoice lifecycle management solutions. axios.link/4gQyToG 

 • CapSpire , a Falfurrias Management Partners portfolio company, acquired FinTark , a London-based commodity trading and risk management consultancy. axios.link/4gwgyvH 

 • HighGrove Partners acquired O&amp;A Landscaping , an Orlando, Fla.-based commercial landscaping company. axios.link/4xEdyVL 

 • Kelso &amp; Co. invested in Bearing Distributors , a Cleveland-based distributor of bearings, power transmission and fluid power products. axios.link/4gjV1aP 

 • NewBold Technologies , a Fort Point Capital portfolio company, acquired Spencer Technologies , a Medway, Mass.-based "tech lifecycle partner" to multi-site retail and hospitality brands. axios.link/4zzLfJn 

 • Presidential HVAC , a Gryphon Investors portfolio company, acquired Maryland-focused Shipley Plumbing, Heating &amp; Air Conditioning . axios.link/4gsMhPX 

 💎 Sound Growth Partners invested in Diamond Art Club , a diamond painting kit maker. axios.link/45PMp5P 

 • Superstep Capital acquired Zencore , an independent Google Cloud consultancy. axios.link/4d2H1QC 

 🍪 Sweetmore Bakeries , a Shore Capital Partners portfolio company, acquired Fantasy Baking , a Sylmar, Calif.-based maker of private label cookies and bars, from Encore Consumer Partners . axios.link/4xny4ty 

 • Vistria Group agreed to buy a majority stake in Curi Capital , a Chicago-based RIA with over $14b in assets under advisement. axios.link/3SeqT7H 

 • Vital Records Control , backed by Windjammer Capital , acquired AskTuring , a San Diego-based AI platform for analyzing internal data repositories. axios.link/4cd7yKR 

 
 
